{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41171","headline":"淮阳感怀 · 李密","name":"淮阳感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金风荡初节，玉露凋晚林。\n此夕穷涂士，郁陶伤寸心。\n野平葭苇合，村荒藜藿深。\n眺听良多感，徙倚独沾襟。\n沾襟何所爲，怅然怀古意。\n秦俗犹未平，汉道将何翼。\n樊哙市井徒，萧何刀笔吏。\n一朝时运会，千古传名諡。\n寄言世上雄，虚生真可媿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}